
# synth/tables/ WAS ignored here until 2026-08-21.  PREREG.md section 3 held
# the twenty generated tables back "until after all model runs are complete",
# because a table that has never left this machine cannot be in a training
# corpus, and that is the only novelty guarantee available without a vendor's
# disclosure.  The roster completed 16 of 16, so the condition is met and the
# tables are now published: they are the artefact section 8 rests on, and a
# memorisation control nobody can inspect is not a control.
#
# Publishing them SPENDS that guarantee permanently.  From here they may enter
# future training corpora, so section 8's result is a statement about the
# models as they were in August 2026, not a reusable benchmark.  Anyone
# re-running it on a later model needs a fresh generator seed.
synth/.codexroot/
.DS_Store
